1542			\[
1543				\bigotimes_{i=1}^{M} \bigotimes_{j=1}^{\log q} \sigma^W_{u_{ij}}\;,
1544			\]
1545			where $\kappa(u_i) = (u_{ij})_{1 \le j \le \log q}$ under the bijection $\kappa\colon \F_q \to \F_2^{\log q}$ of Chapter~\ref{chap:qpbt-algebra}.
